[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9964.309, "timestamp": "02:46:04", "text": "看。所以，我的浏览器主界面是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9967.269, "timestamp": "02:46:07", "text": "场景中我正在进行像素聊天。卡帕根。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9970.469, "timestamp": "02:46:10", "text": "Capagen 就是你输入表情符号时用的那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9973.269, "timestamp": "02:46:13", "text": "呃，如果你在 Twitch 上使用表情符号的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9976.07, "timestamp": "02:46:16", "text": "YouTube，它会出现在屏幕上。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9978.469, "timestamp": "02:46:18", "text": "一个卡帕根和触发点火。我使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9981.59, "timestamp": "02:46:21", "text": "触发Twitch评论的触发机制。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9985.99, "timestamp": "02:46:25", "text": "你可以把它用在你的 YouTube 频道上。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9989.67, "timestamp": "02:46:29", "text": "流元素主要警报。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10002.389, "timestamp": "02:46:42", "text": "问题是，呃，主要原因是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10007.59, "timestamp": "02:46:47", "text": "我想问的是，该怎么称呼它？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10013.349, "timestamp": "02:46:53", "text": "优化那些显而易见的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10014.95, "timestamp": "02:46:54", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10018.95, "timestamp": "02:46:58", "text": "呃，现在是779。"}]